{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36617","headline":"广陵春日忆池阳有寄 · 罗隐","name":"广陵春日忆池阳有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烟水蒙蒙接板桥，数年经历驻征桡。\n醉凭危槛波千顷，愁倚长亭柳万条。\n别後故人冠獬豸，病来知己赏鹪鹩。\n清流夹宅千家住，会向闲乘一信潮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36617.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36617","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}